{{#each failed}}
- **{{item}}** ({{class}}) — {{reason}}
  - span: lines {{span_first}}–{{span_last}} of the Draft as it stood
{{#each evidence}}
  - evidence: {{text}}
{{/each}}
{{#each pairs}}
{{#if has_declared}}
  - the declared `{{item}}` entry `{{declared}}` was not recovered — {{verdict}}: {{reason}}
{{else}}
  - pair {{#if whole}}(whole item){{else}}{{pair}}{{/if}} — {{verdict}}: {{reason}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
